#. Description of the theme
#: style.css
msgid "ArneIron Lite is an accessible block theme with a dark \"Old Arnie\" look (near-black canvas, signal-red accent), seven more style variations including a light one, and full-site-editing templates, template parts and block patterns made from core blocks. Header, mobile menu and footer work with no plugin installed; with WooCommerce or Polylang active, their cart, account and language blocks appear in the header. Optional: the free ArneIron Blocks plugin adds design blocks such as hero, pricing, FAQ and carousel."
msgstr ""

